# Frontend FSD

## Simplified FSD Structure

- `app/` — providers, router, root layout
- `pages/` — route-level pages
- `features/` — features with model (Zustand stores) and ui
- `entities/` — domain entities UI
- `shared/` — UI components, api client, lib

## State Management

- Zustand for global state
- Feature stores in `features/<name>/model/`

## Code Style

- JSDoc and comments in Russian for complex logic
